        "bold": false,
        "text": "Multicam Cut\n\nUpload the recordings of one conversation: a camera per speaker, a wide shot and the master audio (the mixer or recorder track). Audio Sync lines their clocks up, Transcribe reads the master with speaker labels, the Tighten Plan node (Cloud) trims the episode, Camera Switch (Cloud) puts each stretch on the camera of whoever is talking, and Apply Cut renders it as a 720p Preview first. Review it, then choose Render final on Apply Cut. The sound always comes from the master; only the picture switches.\n\nDrop a file on each recording node, then Run down the chain.\n\nTo skip the review, set Apply Cut's Quality to Final.",
