    {
      "id": "multicam-note-sources",
      "type": "sticky-note",
      "zIndex": -1,
      "position": {
        "x": -580,
        "y": -60
      },
      "data": {
        "bold": false,
        "text": "The recordings\n\nMaster Audio is the clock and the soundtrack: Tighten Plan marks it as master audio, and Audio Sync measures every camera against it. Camera 1 and Camera 2 are the close-ups; Wide Camera is marked Wide, so Camera Switch cuts to it now and then and falls back to it when a speaker has no camera.\n\nMore cameras (2 to 6 recordings in all): add an Upload Video node and wire it into both Audio Sync's and Tighten Plan's Sources. Fewer: delete the node. Every recording node needs a file before you run.",
        "color": "#2d2d44",
        "label": "Sticky Note",
        "width": 440,
        "height": 380,
        "italic": false,
        "fontSize": "base",
        "alignment": "left",
        "textColor": "#ffffff"
      },
      "measured": {
        "width": 440,
        "height": 380
      }
    },
