      "data": {
        "bold": false,
        "text": "The render\n\nApply Cut reads each camera at the right moment from the switched edit itself, so the cameras are not wired into it. Render final runs Camera Switch again on the reviewed cut first, so a stretch you restore gets a camera too, then renders at full quality. Its Transcript output is the named transcript remapped onto the cut: wire it into an Add Captions node to caption the episode.",
